            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Report on a mycotic and arteriosclerotic aneurysm of the right coronary artery in a 13-year-old girl and a 43-year-old man. With the help of the casuistics and the existing literature the author adopts a definite attitude to genesis, frequency, localisation and complication of the aneurysma.</AbstractText>
